abstract: Replication of the well known Artificial Anasazi model that simulates the
  population dynamics between 800 and 1350 in the Long House Valley in Arizona. See
  also Marco A. Janssen (2009) Understanding Artificial Anasazi, Journal of Artificial
  Societies and Social Simulation 12 (4) 13 http://jasss.soc.surrey.ac.uk
